                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Which platform is best for D2C at scale?</h3>
                                        <p>Depends on channel priority. Klaviyo email-primary + Shopify. Braze mobile-first + push + in-app. Iterable data-driven + complex segmentation. Match to primary channel + scale.</p>
                                        <h3>Klaviyo enterprise vs Braze / Iterable?</h3>
                                        <p>Klaviyo strong for D2C + Shopify at scale. Braze + Iterable stronger for mobile-first + complex enterprise omnichannel. Different fits.</p>
